.git
.gitignore
.github
.venv
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
backend/.venv
backend/venv
backend/.env
**/*.log
.playwright-mcp
node_modules
.vercel
api/
middleware.js
vercel.json
*.md
# Fonts, anywhere in the build context. Zetta Serif is LICENSED and the image is pushed to a
# registry, so no image may carry it; the server mounts it at runtime instead (compose files).
# This matters even though git no longer tracks the files: deploy/ship.sh builds from the local
# working tree, where backend/fonts/ still holds them for local dev. `**/` covers the root too.
**/*.otf
**/*.otc
**/*.ttf
**/*.ttc
**/*.woff
**/*.woff2
